---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  noindex={true}
  title="How it works"
  description="How to use Image Identifier: select an image, review evidence, export an analysis report."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-fg m-0">How it works</h1>
    <ol class="mt-6 text-muted leading-relaxed pl-5 space-y-3">
      <li>Select a JPEG or PNG on the home page (drag-and-drop or browse).</li>
      <li>The tool validates the file in your browser, then runs available checks.</li>
      <li>Review the evidence summary and open each results tab.</li>
      <li>Optionally start the statistical check (may download a model the first time).</li>
      <li>Export a JSON analysis report or print — labeled as a report, not a certificate.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Missing evidence does not prove authenticity. Conflicting signals are shown when present. Read
      the <a href="/guides/">guides</a> before relying on any single label.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-10 text-sm">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-elevated px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-fg no-underline hover:border-accent/50"
      >
        Open the tool
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
